      "id": 129529,
      "name": "Killswitch",
      "username": "Killswitch",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/killswitch/{size}/2116_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-27T17:56:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes they can. The only reason they wouldn't be able to see each other is if there was an elevation 4 between you both. Both characters must be on a value greater than any obstructing elevations to see past it. So even though a 4 is equal to 4, the 3 is too low. But in your case, they can see each other perfectly fine, even if Bunker was on a 1 and Blade was on a 4.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:04:29.277Z",
