      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Yes they can. The only reason they wouldn&#39;t be able to see each other is if there was an elevation 4 between you both. Both characters must be on a value greater than any obstructing elevations to see past it. So even though a 4 is equal to 4, the 3 is too low. But in your case, they can see each other perfectly fine, even if Bunker was on a 1 and Blade was on a 4.</p>",
